[HR][/HR]

Feedback and test reports are welcome. When reporting a problem, please include: [B]plugin version[/B], [B]Lyrion version and OS[/B], [B]player model[/B], whether you use [B]unicast or multicast[/B], and the relevant lines from server.log plus the stats file.

Windows-only for now; the upstream Linux plugin still works on Linux.
